cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this project and the pinned JevLight and CityFlow sources when using the released code or results."
title: "Traffic-Qwen Decision: Specialized Non-Generative Decision Model for Adaptive Traffic Signal Control"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-09
abstract: >-
  A Qwen3.5-0.8B QLoRA/Clef dual-choice traffic-signal controller evaluated
  with CityFlow on the Jinan 3x4 scenario. The included V1 result is a guarded
  JevLight action imitation baseline, not RL or a generalization claim.
keywords:
  - traffic signal control
  - CityFlow
  - decision models
  - QLoRA
  - JevLight
